 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello, how's your day going?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_03",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "All good here.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.3,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_27"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What are good gifts for someone who just started running?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Good running socks are a surprisingly big deal, and a light reflective vest if they run in the dark.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "She runs in the mornings before work, in winter.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a headlamp and some thin gloves would be really useful. Maybe a warm headband too.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.76,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What about a watch?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "A GPS watch is lovely but pricey. If she's new, she might prefer a simple app on her phone first.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, so headlamp and gloves",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "and maybe the socks.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.85,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a solid bundle. Wrap it with a note about her first race, if she's planning one.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
